      <body>This capability provides the ability to represent information about physically realized parts, assembly structures of physically realized parts and results gained by testing physically realized parts of assemblies. The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;IndividualPart_domainModel_Overview.png&lt;/name&gt;Simplified overview of the AP242 individual part Domain model&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
    </ownedComment>
    <name>IndividualPart</name>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1509117775937_712663_37985" xmi:uuid="00f75e81-18d8-43ba-8c72-de586c296bdc" xmi:type="uml:Association">
      <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1509117775937_349304_37986"/>
      <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1509117775903_191103_37952"/>
