    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193181_803275_23737" xmi:uuid="1ba2cae2-885d-4e4e-8fea-3e2fc2791318" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455111209370_663964_42319" xmi:uuid="5559285a-de95-4f5b-8318-258761ad6ef3" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193181_803275_23737"/>
        <body>A PlannedIndividualPart is a type of IndividualPartVersion that represents a version of a planned artefact. &lt;note&gt; It may be planned to make the artefact from of a version of a part design (PartVersion). If this is the case, then the relationship between the artefact (PlannedIndividualPart) and the design (PartVersion) is represented by PartVersionToIndividualPartVersionAssociation. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; If the planned artefact (PlannedIndividualPart) is subsequently made into an actual artefact (RealizedIndividualPart) then they are related by the ProductPlannedToRealized relationship.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PlannedIndividualPart</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193759_985048_27384" xmi:uuid="6b37d390-ebe9-4521-b3d0-249f2d0a8f24" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193126_848021_23615"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1523346338922_590299_137000" xmi:uuid="ecc298ac-15f6-4d19-a386-bd7ce1083bf3" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <name>planned_individual_part</name>
        <visibility>private</visibility>
