    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193218_446236_23802" xmi:uuid="26d52cd1-b604-4d7a-82b1-415509fedac3" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455111311428_512312_42323" xmi:uuid="d6d46f70-ade3-4465-8c79-950a3d6a9885" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193218_446236_23802"/>
        <body>A RealizedIndividualPart is a type of IndividualPartVersion that represents a version of a realized artefact. &lt;note&gt; Where physical parts are being represented, the RealizedIndividualPart represents the physical part - something one can touch. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; The artefact may have been made from a version of a part design (PartVersion). If this is the case, then the relationship between the artefact (RealizedIndividualPart) and the design (PartVersion) is represented by PartVersionToIndividualPartVersionAssociation. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; The artefact may have been planned and represented by PlannedIndividualPart. In which case, the actual artefact (RealizedIndividualPart) is related to the planned artefact (PlannedIndividualPart) by the ProductPlannedToRealized relationship.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>RealizedIndividualPart</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193760_885851_27392" xmi:uuid="b5b8077c-5411-4a41-a9b6-6e24401d662b" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
