      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193763_357217_27406" xmi:uuid="7f0fd01f-867a-432c-853d-42e11aa32a93" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455110210160_465149_42282" xmi:uuid="eba29293-a815-420e-9311-ff63c254a0c2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193763_357217_27406"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following class names shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'derivation': defines a deriving relationship where the Related IndividualPartVersion is based on the Relating IndividualPartVersion which is an earlier version of the same or of a different IndividualPart; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'hierarchy': defines a hierarchical relationship where the Related IndividualPartVersion is a subordinate version of the Relating IndividualPartVersion; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'sequence': defines a version sequence where the Relating IndividualPartVersion is the preceding version of the Related IndividualPartVersion that is the following version. For a give IndividualPartVersionthere shall be at most one IndividualPartVersionRelationship of this RelationType referring to this IndividualPartVersion as Relating and at most one IndividualPartVersionRelationship of this RelationType referring as Related.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
