        <annotatedElement href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_290014c_1550847743191_208266_98071"/>
        <body>These flowports are not bound to the ARM target because only a product definition property type can be assigned to it.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455110307015_943135_42285" xmi:uuid="a448d1e2-122a-40dd-a8c4-34402678fe3c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193127_5418_23617"/>
        <body>An IndividualPartView is a characterization view of a version of an IndividualPart. &lt;note&gt; The IndividualPartView supports the representation of different views of an IndividualPart for different purposes. Multiple views of the same IndividualPart are represented by different instances of IndividualPartView for the same IndividualPartVersion. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1526401951387_298341_183091" xmi:uuid="da0fde77-db71-4e61-9660-9defc248fbfa" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
