    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193126_848021_23615" xmi:uuid="d6ce66d5-ee86-4714-94c9-91a9e8efc5da" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455109942110_168800_42271" xmi:uuid="c92cf956-79ce-4784-acca-41e7c9477f22" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193126_848021_23615"/>
        <body>An IndividualPartVersion is a version of an IndividualPart and acts as a collector of the views of this version. &lt;example&gt;The car on my drive is represented by an IndividualPart. The current configuration status of the car can be represented by an IndividualPartVersion related to that IndividualPart. If a safety modification is made to the car resulting in a new configuration status of the car, then this may be represented by a new IndividualPartVersion. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1526401738437_409003_182272" xmi:uuid="faabc738-7dde-4dab-9965-e28d900917a2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
